               <text>
                  <paragraph>colloidal silicon dioxide, corn starch, d&amp;c yellow # 10, hypromellose, methacrylic acid ethyl acrylate copolymer, microcrystalline cellulose, povidone, pregelatinized starch, sodium bicarbonate, sodium lauryl sulfate, stearic acid, talc, titanium dioxide, triacetin, triethyl citrate</paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20261028"/>
            </section>
         </component>
